# IMDb Top 1000 Movies - Decision Tree Classification

This project uses a Decision Tree classification model to predict whether a movie has an IMDb rating of 8.0 or higher.

The model uses:
- Meta_score
- No_of_Votes

It includes data preparation, train/test splitting, model training, accuracy, confusion matrix, precision, recall, F1-score, and a new movie prediction with probability.

